  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[eslint-config-algolia](https://www.npmjs.com/package/eslint-config-algolia) just published its new version 5.5.0.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :rotating_light:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      eslint-config-algolia\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      5.5.0\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build went from success to failure**.\n\nAs eslint-config-algolia is “only” a devDependency of this project it **might not break production or downstream projects**, but “only” your build or test tools – **preventing new deploys or publishes**.\n\nI recommend you give this issue a high priority. I’m sure you can resolve this :muscle:\n\nOf course this could just be a false positive, caused by a flaky test suite, or third parties that are currently broken or unavailable, but that would be another problem I’d recommend working on.\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n\nThe new version differs by 27 commits .\n- [`a8451b9`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/a8451b99536ad7ed037f1655bb2d5bae743e9b66) <code>release v5.5.0</code>\n- [`e2054f4`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/e2054f47177b7c820dd28bab19ce0a9cf3dcdebf) <code>feat(import): allow using webpack resolver, to lint resolve{alias}</code>\n- [`a43d4fd`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/a43d4fdecff3c511da62a42975ad38d771cdb67d) <code>release v5.4.0</code>\n- [`6f07294`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/6f072949f29eb0f508127ae575767bb433449613) <code>feat(eslint): add new rules since July</code>\n- [`d40461d`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/d40461d05cf726ee882766b4a9db866524e1fcda) <code>chore(package): fix dependencies, add npmrc</code>\n- [`ed5e84a`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/ed5e84a59af33f0a21ce1cf57161c7f4b586ccf5) <code>Merge pull request #13 from algolia/greenkeeper-eslint-plugin-react-6.1.2</code>\n- [`edd2ec5`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/edd2ec57a08b48d4852cca1000305dc895b7b6ac) <code>chore(package): update eslint-plugin-react to version 6.1.2</code>\n- [`f3fc8a5`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/f3fc8a5a77a9f931344ed0b0d7951d3a0e8b7aff) <code>release v5.3.1</code>\n- [`6bec583`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/6bec583991c210fd921c4e909cfd1abe9b079fd8) <code>fix(dep): add forgotten dep</code>\n- [`b8a54cd`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/b8a54cdb6067615abf2a03cb1851eabc6f972550) <code>release v5.3.0</code>\n- [`c38dbd1`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/c38dbd141eec67641512c4fa641ebf5b9a37b548) <code>Merge pull request #9 from algolia/feat/Jasmine-Jest</code>\n- [`333288c`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/333288cc9c340b51cf8bb5483be3659cddb57e4c) <code>feat(Jasmine): provide set of rules for Jasmine tests</code>\n- [`d304116`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/d3041162990e500c2f8dbb258bf3ddef19fe0def) <code>release v5.2.2</code>\n- [`380c437`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/380c437470c22b330d30315a28ff4d5e585ffa06) <code>docs(TOC): fix</code>\n- [`e2953fe`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/e2953feb2143472a7e9dd4d5f3d5b24f1460c35e) <code>docs(CHANGELOG): desc before doctoc</code>\n\nThere are 27 commits in total. See the [full diff](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/compare/d283010e24008c2302689f84936d81fca504d2ff...a8451b99536ad7ed037f1655bb2d5bae743e9b66).\n\n---\n\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>\n",
